# Wargling: "Ferocious - Whenever this creature attacks while you control a creature with power 4 or greater, until end of turn,
# this creature gets +1/+0 and creatures you control gain trample." The "while" is part of the trigger event, checked only as
# Wargling attacks and not again on resolution (no intervening "if", CR 603.4; the ruling). On turn 3 Bot2 exiles the Alpine Grizzly
# (power 4) with Swords to Plowshares in response to the trigger: it still resolves, a 3/2 Wargling with trample.

